  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 2.008,
      "text": "A robot watches a video.",
      "beat": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.008,
      "end": 7.426,
      "text": "It tries to copy a human. But can it learn\nwhat the camera never sees?",
      "beat": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.606,
      "end": 9.639,
      "text": "A single camera records flat images.",
      "beat": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.639,
      "end": 13.648,
      "text": "A robot needs the motion of real 3D parts,\neven when a hand hides them.",
      "beat": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 13.828,
      "end": 16.831,
      "text": "UC Berkeley researchers built\nRobot See Robot Do,",
      "beat": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.831,
      "end": 20.14,
      "text": "presented at the Conference on Robot\nLearning in 2024.",
      "beat": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 20.32,
      "end": 22.087,
      "text": "First, they scan the object.",
      "beat": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 22.087,
      "end": 27.073,
      "text": "From one demonstration video, the model\nestimates how the parts move over time.",
      "beat": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 27.253,
      "end": 29.891,
      "text": "That reconstructed motion\nguides a robot planner.",
      "beat": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 29.891,
      "end": 33.768,
      "text": "The robot can attempt the movement,\neven from a different starting pose.",
      "beat": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 33.948,
      "end": 38.167,
      "text": "But here's the catch: a bad scan, hidden\nparts, or the wrong camera angle",
      "beat": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 38.167,
      "end": 41.982,
      "text": "can break the reconstruction.\nOne video is not a universal lesson.",
      "beat": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 42.162,
      "end": 45.589,
      "text": "Their experiments include hinged objects\nand a moving toy.",
      "beat": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 45.589,
      "end": 47.775,
      "text": "So what exactly is the robot copying?",
      "beat": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 47.955,
      "end": 50.826,
      "text": "Not the human hand,\nbut the object's movement.",
      "beat": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 50.826,
      "end": 55.631,
      "text": "Save this video if you found it useful,\nand subscribe for the next discovery.",
      "beat": 8
    }
  ]
}